-- auto-apply
-- Repair the remaining broken characters (U+FFFD) in article_cache: 91 text cells in 79
-- articles (sentence analysis translation / vocab / grammar). 20261031_fix_broken_chars_article_cache.sql
-- restored 52 translations but the Supabase query API corrupted some multi-byte characters on the
-- way in again (bytes mangled even with JSON \u escapes), and the grammar / vocab columns were not
-- covered. Every value here travels as base64 (ASCII only) and is decoded by Postgres, so nothing
-- in transit can break it. 69 spots restored from the article body / clean text of the same
-- article, 24 by hand. Guarded by md5 of the broken value: a re-run or a later edit is never
-- overwritten. qa_at is set so content-qa doesn't requeue them.

